<title>USA: Clinton starts budget meeting with congressmen.</title>
<headline>Clinton starts budget meeting with congressmen.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton begun a meeting at the White House on Wednesday with leaders of congressional budget committees, a White House spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The meeting began at 2:30 p.m. EST (1930 GMT), the spokeswoman said. Clinton invited the committee leaders to the White House for a parley to resuscitate negotiations on eliminating the federal budget deficit by 2002.</p>
</text>
